  m_text: 'The focus of this world is to practice CQB positioning and movement in
    a virtual reality environment. \n Thus, there is no: \nheadshots, timers, score,
    grenades, explosives, reloads, recoil, over penetration, wall penetration, drones,
    knives, getting shot, friendly fire, AI movement, non combatants, humanoid target
    models, etc.'
