  m_text: Future updates?\nAs of now, the door swings both ways. I might make common
    realistic doors that swing only way, which means two more types of doors that
    swing either left or right. If I do that, both the binary space partitioning
    (BSP) room generation algorithm and target spawner needs to be updated to work
    with doors that swing only one way. While the BSP algorithm works fine, there
    is much room for improvement.
