      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Thoughts:\nI made this world because I wanted to create a random house
    layout generator and to try vibe coding in Unity. This eventually became a kill
    house random room generator for VR CQB practice/training. Checking AI code for
    bugs and hallucinations was annoying as expected. Overall, it was an interesting
    experience and I''m happy with how everything turned out. \nI hope you had fun
    too. Thank you for visiting my world.  \n\nCredits: \nChatGPT, Claude, Gemini
    and my friends. \nhttps://pixabay.com/sound-effects/film-special-effects-ding-101492/
    \nhttps://pixabay.com/sound-effects/film-special-effects-gunshot-352466/ \n\n
    Door Kickers 1 and 2 are great games.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
